@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName SansSerif
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam ArrowColor #334155
skinparam BorderColor #334155
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #FFF8DC
skinparam NoteBorderColor #B6A16C
skinparam roundcorner 8
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam maxMessageSize 300
title SS-07  Review and publish learning content
' Requirements: CONTENT-01 CONTENT-02 CONTENT-03 CONTENT-04 CONTENT-05 CONTENT-06 PATH-01 PATH-02 PATH-03 ASSESS-01 ASSESS-02 ASSESS-05 NOTICE-01 NOTICE-02 P-01 P-02 P-03
hide footbox
autonumber

actor "Faculty owner" as F
participant "CS-GAMUERS" as S
actor "Program Head" as H
F -> S: Save owned content draft or draft revision
S --> F: Save draft; show validation feedback without discarding edits
F -> S: Submit draft for publication review
alt Required content is incomplete or invalid
  S --> F: Keep draft and identify fields to correct
else Complete valid submission
  S --> H: Show submitted content in review dashboard
  H -> S: Review exact submission; approve, request changes, or reject
  alt Submission changed since review began
    S --> H: Refuse outdated approval; require current review
  else Changes requested or submission rejected
    S --> F: Show and email result with reason
  else Publication approved
    S --> F: Show published revision and email approval
    note over S
    Existing course learners keep their started revision.
    New starts use the latest published revision.
    Unfinished diagnostic attempts keep their form.
    Career-path changes do not replace accepted roadmaps.
    end note
  end
end
note over S
Email failure never reverses a saved decision.
Show current state in permitted dashboards.
Administrator account support sees delivery failure,
without private learning content.
Retry delivery only; never repeat the decision (P-01).
end note
footer CS-GAMUERS | SS-07 | Product behavior
@enduml
